{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1383,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:917c5cb4d562d4590bbcfabd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝ランニングしてたら、商店街の\r\nおっちゃんも走っててさ…アタシに\r\n勝とうとすんだよ？元気だよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b9fa855add5cb077beeb33a9b6c57ab49c1280d43a9809667937c9a5db7debe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b346e87a40ee7097f1835d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝から着付けをすると、気が\r\n引き締まりますな～。まあ、中身は\r\nいつものネイチャさんですけど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f97fc4d1f292bc8712d44c02e20fb4203328a64de6b63122eae16fb43cd0e4f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f40bced62cc4cee77a7651",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お昼、一緒にお蕎麦でもどうです？\r\n実はいい店見つけちゃってさ～。\r\nにんじんの天ぷら、絶品ですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb89bc4dc02287749e22a9d6b167a4b2cf9e20a06948278b72c20d0697b25614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e96fb0a4cc06b55f05a275a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふわぁ～…とと、昼寝はまずいか。\r\nこんなド高そうな振袖に、\r\nシワなんかつけられませんって…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68fe6e7cbeffec8be7abc3a0ae297eeb19c745f14f63c1d5dd904c1c8340b4c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62fdb3239b997548c6f5978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん、お疲れですな？…仕事の反省は\r\nいったんやめてさ。お風呂入って、\r\n牛乳でもクイッといきましょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc1193519df57083c472115e4a2eee7a2c809dfca93a3fdb3b05fd9647a4576",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad5975cc820889ce901d261f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、夕飯に焼き餅でも\r\nどうです？商店街のみんなが山ほど\r\nくれたのが、まだ余っててさ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e4e027cad39ddfc044579b0754d7ea45675fa684b359f8e554c288a23f2a36f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b04aab92d855922b99b5fc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ～…そいやさ、商店街のみんなが\r\nお花見誘ってくれたんだけど。\r\n…予定、聞いてもいい？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9d5ad00956f5210682f8ec089be2ad182770194811300ebbf7244d6761e1fb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2203a01054c6e805274ff59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "や～夏はしょっぱいものに\r\n限りますなぁ。砂肝をつまみに、\r\nコーラでキュッといきますか～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac7c580a21f2efe343d444c2c4b30e15f60bd5897f7712c758cf91c58d4dfe83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350fc7ced2a93c4210e9b9d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紅葉にも映える格好でしょ？\r\n…って、自分で言ってて恥ずかし！\r\n…顔が紅葉みたい？も、もぉぉ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a03ceb626f40c16a976ffab8feda76216b04ef246dc896abd39739726b0e94f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2eeef25287dbace39ff01efd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着物にコタツ、そして丸くなってる\r\nお猫さん！いや～、冬にはやっぱり\r\n猫は欠かせませんにゃ～…なぁ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3dd1d39ae89a5175dc8412bd58151ad734ac58fa551f8842bfb06078b6e7e4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96cf35b2402c769f419b2b0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン",
      "source_fingerprint": "205aa64f55aa5b5868c584cadc0b5dcd8e05b84b0a76c8efb1da86986277c562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77da3c884270173a070eb8e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王，今天也在闪闪发光啊\n…真是精神饱满啊。\n各种意义上的比不过啊～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a2569fc0ec3372eb2d31b8b52fc3f478acaffa69b8b3134553acda08cd01a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862247d31479d89faa4e38cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看邮购节目时不知不觉就\n买东西了…前几天也是，\n买了些蝮蛇的粉末…",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9485eb26afb960ef62353cae09ffa9c5047b73c4d1992366521a315b2608052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e965d5da5a9da861bf84e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "房间里有个好闹钟。\n喊着『美妙！』\n就这么起床了的马娘。哈哈…哈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb9c83e942156ce5c24b570671e7f9872ffab8b10c68e16c32ac259b5c22254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79c74adda47eee81dffcfd12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀ー。从刚才开始总觉得\n～有猫的声音…才发现手机，\n还开着猫的视频。真好笑啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad893d1447954f81d38559047e1b07de42d1133a73ac6d193b9bc52830ca3a13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a3ecacf7a108fe245242a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有活泼女孩的地方，\n总感觉会很精神呢。\n…哈，去摸猫猫来充电吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0015a9ca91ab2f6d516abc103292aa47fdd6195b28bed3f6a2c9aa40c2a56e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553c17d1b48505e19e2e120d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "额！这不是把肚脐都露出来了吗！\n真的需要吗，这个。\n…演唱会前偷偷延长吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c08636478677d4bc9786d955dd6974b307abbd27a2763d08cbaf858defe9b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8462846e9c0699988c2eaf8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇哈ー。轻飘飘的呢～。\n然后洋溢出来的，穿着的感觉。\n啊ー…差，差不多该脱了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0b09042b198df322bf7639569ce759363ba79a85328eb6d17672148b51e08ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7a73d5787d415cc1c41176",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…嗯嗯～，可恶。嘴角要翘起来了。\n我的决胜服，做的…\n可真好啊…太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee17e004c3e7f54af5a5e58cc593aeb12251a3b77432a0ae911d697aa3caba9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:678e5cbe5865cf3160904839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这个赢了的话很帅呢…\n怎么说呢！啊哈哈哈。\n…嘛，我会尽力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a465e3e43178ee1bef94b1d2e8fab9e02da039a24f1db26209730514d1bd2a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27c95573eeb61b0ec8415a84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的时候总想\n『噗咻！』地出去呢～。…你那是什么表情？\n不，是说罐装咖啡啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e8f7e6a14585fa340b6c142589e037a4a82429c91eee3a24d95162fdec59888",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01d0f2445552b7b41c6ea70f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻轻地跑吧～。…毕竟，\n不是训练，也没有饿肚子。\n又不是那种热血的角色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4865a8063c81867198eb7eb691f93c134852b1fc70a8ee75f7965f0a90e7ec49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e920c17c541d2bc5be7bb70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重炮明明说要熬夜，但一跟她说\n成熟的女人要早睡才能保持美丽\n她就马上就去睡觉了！…真好搞定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45cd4dd99edea9d8f1c6b6cd0a37a3d7c2db4800f2c7f077af22812bf3b516f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01e847fc3f4bb1b3238e40f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着轻飘飘，很有春天气息的孩子，\n又增加了呢～。眼福眼福♪\n果然还是要穿亮闪闪的衣服才行啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ce5031ec0e8591cc16f32af3900a6b8b4e7ec7ea57ba83b88715253cd182dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f219de27bf3ae6973f30d58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我喜欢桑拿，\n但是这个热天和那个不一样啊～…\n饶了我吧～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1e2aa171265dbc460faa9d39a3a78e3b822c15cee34978411234c7de126c324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80422ab459d418cb0b64c425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天，秋刀鱼的骨头飞快地\n就挑完了。哎呀，这种朴素地喜悦\n…这也是秋天的乐趣啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e30ba4bf71895abdac77ce844c094fd3d8f941f11a3915dc5a4ec0af08d964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b444f4b925ca7810dae97ea5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这么冷的时候去泡露天温泉的话，\n真是太棒了…\n啊啊～，好想去温泉啊～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76f3b49509c3481c0dcd832d086b6f84df63097ed65cc879fe8e0a3880d91f9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0904bac1e04bb3cfb3c35e13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然会感到被期待的压力。\r\n但从实际上来讲\r\n还是很感谢大家的支持的…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c67c970dddcab05576801b0962a12138d9e2e241a29a57ca3bae4f72c5151dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a12ac8c001380be2c3e0c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光环很认真，\r\n只要有做的不好的地方ー。\r\n就会不自觉地多管闲事呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014c8b0662f38fa89dc7447c65af4b84040149e0130b67345cbf48dd86b38f90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9671d74dc26462ef5696bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "采珠同学能认真地关注着大家，\r\n好厉害啊。虽然她也有奇宝子怪怪的地方…\r\n不过总有人生前辈的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d7de5d7a2360d5eb71bdd37e533595560085d3666d5370128700d772aeaa7d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab7d3bcaff86dc782c64c8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家那个小弟弟也说\r\n要给我加油。\r\n…这下姐姐必须得努力才行啊ー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aa05e0d536d86fd44d08b3568f781360884552d66635530302ab78c1d3d19a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2d5f4a4bf5eb76ee79f802a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，我的发型有没有变得很怪？\r\n刚才被喊着『蓬蓬发型才Marvelous☆』\r\n然后头发被乱抓了一通…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd561efb3f98cae5c4634b33e5559ae7cd6ce40e791078ebb5248f20d956862d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:145f2a3ae191cb88d76b2d96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摩耶和涡轮从早上开始\r\n就在开心地跑圈～。\r\n光看着她们就能打起精神来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c7087c1400050ed309abd0942dc7050c9569bc5d0d9a1e59fa8d9ca1f2cd6bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0868b1cf0d7f06090edbec35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "内恰姐来给你加个油，\r\n帮你熬过下午吧？\r\n呜…别用那么期待的眼神看着我啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "476edbd8aa0c3beee93a764f9c50b8d4c8c27f1c35a9b02d7b098e42d4ce5cde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:400e01dc23e879283f88af0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。鳐鱼翅配可乐，\r\n来一杯吗？无论是发牢骚还是其他琐事，\r\n内恰姐都会听哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f763e755d04b9b740f20f8b430b19d44013273f59c8b6b2088f12ee7f8fe2e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ae77a9308a15bebfceb6b70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带着新生参观学校的时候…\r\n她们那闪闪发光的眼神，\r\n对我来说太刺眼了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "955b3f2f8d3a1803fbdc46f7fd4259d3b28916fa24c304c02216e92b2d0f6581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5240a97487035ba6803c615",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "提到夏天就少不了热血青春！\r\n年轻人们要加油啊ー！\r\n…我就呆在家里吃点素面啥的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2e05140354f64606b337690618976ad897d2f975289928815327cc5e64e050",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8439d6dd3652d317854eaf64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "商店街里要办秋季庆典啊。\r\n毕竟他们一直在给我加油，\r\n我也去帮帮忙吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af20cec550fa8b41dd9de211b12abcd0257a1e20da49907975e8eaa4e9020ae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be99b65ab4ea07c1ac888312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『即便在寒冷的日子里，只要还有人支持，\r\n我的努力就不会至此』会长她说了这么一句话…\r\n噗…不行了笑死我了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d18bf18e674e4f18b8a8880d2d4a159016e8a6af84aa1a146eb6ee9f22b218d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32664468dcb9468e36626c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油ー☆不要输哦！！\r\n辛苦～啦。\r\n…你喜欢哪种？开玩笑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8419be6f6f49454695d9232541505d789a6d3449bdf5fc9e1aeb4955c94f0ccd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70849601ffefd1d3a47ecadb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…有正经的啦啦队感觉吗？\r\n哎呀，这衣服不是很可爱吗？\r\n我说的是自己啊，我自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a8a00387e8e18cb31c291c8c343f62999701238e000267c9d30ce12a76f419e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5990f2a6f8cad3bd9587d787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うう…この髪型、なんか落ち着か\r\nないなー。もしや…あのもふもふ\r\nツインテこそ、アタシの本体…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b8d99bd02a6703c325e5583e55a29637ac4a302905c7cb02f21505f41fc4808",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab766fc15518f41f109a41a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おせちに黒豆あるよね？あれ作って\r\nみたら、結構奥が深くてさ…ふふ、\r\nちょいハマっちゃったかも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c4443dfb58493df1534145d9f102d139863f0a6783ad8d71bbb9516900adfca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff7047cae146413f679ea04d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年の初夢、鷹もナスも出なかった\r\nけど、マーベラス！って叫ぶ子が\r\n出てきてさ…縁起よさそうだよね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "21634c9555d21a43bbcc1585a07a2abc740cecba54ec83eec1d28e614b50b674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3df69473a8091e574c2cac48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この振袖姿、イクノたちにも\r\nおだてられまくったんだけど…\r\nいや～！服に着られてるって！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0272699973521065684024f284c9366c034ebd794e62a04873171ae2c7cdfc54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:534c089d780b24848fb13d93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "弟にさ、お年玉…はちと早いから\r\n積み木をあげたら、無邪気に遊んで\r\nくれてさ…カワイかったな～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cd8cf0558606fb90dd679b2f0cbf86acf41a9ddba07458bb9d05c1a3ca13514",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efac459fca5f0cd98156616f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ターボやイクノたちと初日の出\r\n見に行ってさ、綺麗だったな～。\r\n…ま、半数は寝てましたけどね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41168547f71ee08fbf699dd7112ae6bd260c93d59b3b1ef6f978ef910cb6fdf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35839f2d606bf22888ef903c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ありゃ、随分と眠そうな顔ですな。\r\n…5分だけでも昼寝したら？午後の\r\nために、今の自分を労ってこ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4f89db8af00a86b63b7d03d25e307928a3161520318c7ac06c901a90f51d053",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56de99be4149e8f854311222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔、年末にお蕎麦を買い忘れてさ、\r\n家族で年越しうどん作ったんだ。\r\nあれはあれで美味しかったなー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a13f88d6f25c28c5a4c760fe6e99cdb705e68cdb18214bd0276b351e87cf9c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c96a591196f68f917c558c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "商店街の子と遊んでたら、帰り際に\r\nタンポポくれてね…そっか、もう\r\n春かー。季節の巡りは早いな～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d643e76ea787650eb5dde9c5b722218c35810bca101358c2b6c5b13be36186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c81c49911ba9834d83b98f53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あっつ～！もうすっかり夏だね～。\r\n…いや、ならこの格好はおかしく\r\nない！？通気性ゼロですよ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8384a52a85916fc7211e98520bba01b5550fcfb05251e228a3903bc59cddb27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b371c41ffe87519b2760851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋っていいよね～。暑すぎず、\r\n寒すぎずで、尖った特徴がないって\r\nいうか…ん？なんか親近感わくな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fbfee974aa060e8c33b0feafe48e1019d25a4484826ec6e3639627db62bb198",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed7fd552f3c9a8248dc90337",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うー、さむ…！でも上にジャージを\r\n羽織ったら、振袖を着た意味ないし\r\n…オシャレは我慢とはこのことか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "726b90ff8efcc1bfdafa16692a1d1240bbfcc28ea4e26d741708b885846ce4f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f39f5a4d40f0c0f39d27f929",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょい待って…振袖が素敵すぎて、\r\nずっと鏡を見てた数分前の自分を、\r\n戒めてるところだから…ぬあぁっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2201b8f72f6c51d17d777b3b81b8f59eb6103844118b506ee5737489e36629cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:583419e224c8510c0b96fa38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この格好で商店街を歩いてたら、\r\nみんな泣きながら写真撮っててさ…\r\nあの、成人式には早いですよ～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0a9b21703f8072e8ed49822b951945c32e78ee749c3d86972ef3ac907d12780",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a91c3befd9e84c309437ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备万全。随时都可以出发哦。\n…然后，该做什么好呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a720d43c1de8d3eaf4586322796b06a6e3f6ac1f4b6287173a2122ed88ebf133",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17646a20345b02ce37b6c62a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いっちょやりますかー",
      "source_fingerprint": "44415f3336e3b28b4d5f38cf308338717c42acd76d985bfb0e5712f0b4a9b7f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cadaae9d5029b5e180f683c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哟ー。\n慢慢开始吧。\n我会用自己的方式加油的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3097b7cd82ba353671c9dd06679b212c02f198facc8d80b3934a46326eeac75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe29e85ffaa70eaca8425efe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊ー，不要太期待了。\n那样的话，我会不安的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7e8018a1075872c5236ac6f5d096638be4b333bad3fe4c4cd3b645b30b5737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5154fd22468c4b8658de8da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请多多关照。\n嘛，慢慢来就好。\n太过着急也没办法的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02217f81ddfe1986da3662b4bbeecb9aee8bd7422acd2ebbaaeb0c3bcbfbee50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4140ea3309d516932803fc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是训练还是什么，\n训练员你都可以自由安排。\n…我会用结果来回应你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "985bd765c950d677e203f4cee223434d3ede05045fd7025bf2ffc5241f1c4a79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed0089414eec59ce9f44dfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是临阵磨枪\n也比什么都不做好…\n那么，能做多少就做多少吧ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "635d1333544aae66b20c8bacdd9c752fe56fa466cb045fb676a06db85d67fcf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:438479d80b958d066b1fa801",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能做到的事，我会好好做的。\n…虽然是这样的我，\n你也一直在期待着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db99fdb439241f24a3d1b406e06a4f0ec78bd0b1a203c0085c71e2735a08a550",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bdf43931107dce31e8e76ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "积少成多的话。\n…即使只有一点点，\n也是能好好成长的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6b915e69c699c45d17632f278710979343eead2587d349ac4103252cf3e6366",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f06f50286fb91542e11008cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "V・I・C・T・O・R・Y！\r\n…嗯，准备完毕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d02e6f6506c3f08cbd169d08f27e84aeb39fd1e5029bc30c2789662c58502f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e4b1643f11758dc8d1f9fea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，不会让你看到\r\n我难为情的地方的。\r\n毕竟我也是有志气的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "714b2f6e7b5053294988b19fc1c52ed0d713a624659fd06c44455f4c41bb5fe5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d07a84f63280b11d3c32f323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不知道结果会怎样。\r\n但既然受到鼓励了，\r\n就得加油呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5d5e071f3bec8ba4c603bca0c75ef5b96647dcacd1948f59a31db076dc8e9b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43540464958ec1343d4a2e9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好歹也有人在为我加油…\r\n得拿出好结果才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce141a0705d8f3c4e626c61f9449403906876576b31d42fe1bbe6673d5f3ecd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3d8fd7f13e3bae11424866",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇～你那表情…难不成\r\n对我很有期待吗？…没办法了，\r\n再加把劲吧ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9526a59aa3ba124d2b7bf53bab90b27da3721180ff3e256ebd6e0ffb86668f95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3ced68538902891eab16cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也在应援团里呢。\r\n得好好表现一下了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa85614898ab6dbcccda67273ef9c29a2389bb07ea4c9a49487d100db5fdbe74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0171105bf89fd35954a542fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，该打起精神了ー！\r\n不然就太对不起\r\n支持我的训练员了，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1bff812c03eace03595538fb8586c8fac9b6fe2ebf63974f78002d5501830df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:322996a09041c8cafe525cf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さ～て、いっちょやりますか！\r\n…少しくらい、この服に見合う\r\nアタシにならないとね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcf5913d85760b5b652a201433fb9a58a04447cb6b6b99a83b50705b8fa09565",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d05a39c4c3b2223636ad72b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぼーっとしてたら、年なんか\r\nあっという間に過ぎてくじゃん？\r\n毎日コツコツやっていかなきゃね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30111bed7134640da36a0044fbfe00025ece9c7a21037acc72ff905cde41938",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87bd17c913fac3806169b7ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ネイチャさんの、今後の目標――\r\nアタシじゃ無理、って言わない！\r\n…い、言わないったら言わない！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3a2c9b8f9a7ffae5d01d9285580448c020cca8282feb160a9c6cae47a83e7ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44fc9373ace3145887d816fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて、行きますか～…練習終わりに\r\nおしるこ買って帰ろっと。あれ、\r\n疲れた体に染みわたるんだよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be22ee88dc8b17921cd894b3bece55c63e2bfe0b9bee57a98b179c61165f15c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ba3d52a9c22e817d6296e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…みんなさ、振袖姿のアタシを\r\n素敵だって言ってくれてね…ん。\r\nさすがに見せたいよ、勝つとこ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5b4d2430828622f733de33e0e9370d4cbf996e7884b5d4d1f456d8ffc1ba5fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2389636f3ef29ec53ce803",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情けない姿は見せたくないしさ。\r\n…うん。着物の帯、ギュッと\r\n締めてこっか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cbdf09b682c001ee5a3e9cd112dd2760f9bf67e397bd45ffb085f7814336e3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c5fe125d61f4e36272aec58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年こそって、年が明ける度に\r\n思ってたからさ…今年こそ、\r\nそれを先延ばしにしたくないんだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41ca7eda74b8bec6c9695cfe727fe8e57aaa024327b7db3ddfa0c96ce504b726",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e4c6a6727ebf9077c44b8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名训练员，诞生了啊！呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87fd2b349f1664b90f9eb63e3d0dfe51f35894a303f5c2f35b72ef3fa8316803",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e22472c8f1572176f30d781",
